Third-party source in this folder
=================================

Everything under third_party/tapeout-chipyard/ is COPIED, unmodified, from the
EE194/EE290 course tapeout repo (tapeout-chipyard, a fork of Chipyard), commit
48c3a7d11f6de3f0cecb33ae6a31c24ec26ff9d8 (2026-05-24), read from a local
checkout. The sub-folder generators/sp26-atlas-acc comes from that repo's
submodule sp26-atlas-acc at 2ae0bef209df6db78c3de18e8f651bb43855cce9, and
generators/sp26-atlas-acc/dependencies/fpex/model/bf16_exp_model.py from the
submodule fpex at ab0cf6f5b0690538f9ebb1d6af46f7caf97837d4. The paths below
the folder are the original paths, so a tapeout-chipyard checkout can replace
this folder one for one (-DTAPEOUT_CHIPYARD=<checkout>).

